feat(phase5): implement admin profit engine & transparent susu fee system

PHASE 5 COMPLETE - Admin Profit Engine & Cycle Math

This commit implements the final phase of the Susu feature set, adding
a configurable platform fee system with full transparency and audit trails.

Backend Changes:
- Add GlobalSettings.susuProfitPct (default 3%) for configurable fees
- Add SusuCycle.feeUsdc to track per-cycle platform fees
- Add SUSU_PROFIT transaction type and SUSU_FEE profit source
- Implement profit skim logic in susuService.processCycle()
  * Calculates fee: ROUND_DOWN(totalCollected × profitPct)
  * Deducts fee from payout (user receives net amount)
  * Logs to AdminProfitLog with full metadata
  * Creates SUSU_PROFIT transaction for audit trail
- Update adminSettingsController to expose susuProfitPct via API
  * GET /api/admin/settings returns current fee percentage
  * PUT /api/admin/settings accepts updates (validated 0-1 range)
  * All changes logged to AdminSettingsAuditLog

Flutter Changes:
- Add transparent fee breakdown to susu_config_screen.dart
  * Displays: Total Pool, Azaman Fee (%), Net Take-Home Payout
  * Updates dynamically as admin changes contribution amount
  * Color-coded for clarity (red for fees, green for payout)
  * Only shows when member count > 0

Admin Portal Changes:
- Add "Susu Platform Fee" section to Config.jsx
  * Number input for fee percentage (0-1 range, step 0.001)
  * Real-time display of current percentage
  * Save button with toast notifications
  * Positioned between payout settings and KYC section

Financial Impact:
- Default 3% fee on all Susu cycle payouts
- Example: 20 members × $30 = $600 pool → $18 fee → $582 net payout
- Admin-adjustable via web portal (0-100% range)
- ROUND_DOWN calculation prevents over-charging

Security & Compliance:
- Admin-only access to fee configuration
- All changes logged with old→new diffs
- Atomic transactions prevent partial updates
- Full audit trail for regulatory compliance
- Users see fee breakdown BEFORE initiating Susu

Validation:
- ✅ 16/16 automated checks passed
- ✅ All syntax validations passed
- ✅ Schema overlay applied successfully (68 ok, 0 failed)
- ✅ Flutter static analysis passed
- ✅ No breaking changes to existing functionality

Files Modified:
- Backend: schema.prisma, install-susu-overlay.js, susuService.js, adminSettingsController.js
- Flutter: susu_config_screen.dart
- Admin Portal: Config.jsx

Deployment Ready: YES
Breaking Changes: NO
Database Migration: Required (run install-susu-overlay.js)

Refs: Phase 5 Specification, Admin Profit Engine Requirements
